  "releaseNotes": "v12.8.2 - Image Invalidation Fix (November 2025)\n            \n            BUG FIX:\n            🐛 Fixed MAUI's lack of image invalidation with custom NukeImageHandler\n            🐛 Images now properly refresh when source changes\n            \n            IMPROVEMENTS:\n            ✨ Custom image handler for iOS/MacCatalyst\n            ✨ Better image lifecycle management\n            \n            SAMPLES:\n            * Test apps upgraded to .NET 10\n            * Benchmark project updated",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "iOS Nuke native image caching library for dotnet Maui",
